WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:05.569
Marvel Studios has announced what's on their
plate through 2021, giving us plenty to speculate

00:00:05.569 --> 00:00:08.540
about when it comes to just what "Phase 4"
will entail.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:13.860
From plot details to casting rumors to surprising
character connections, here's everything we've

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:14.680
heard so far.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:20.000
On the heels of her tragic death in Avengers:
Endgame, Scarlett Johannson's character Natasha

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.700
Romanoff will be kicking off Phase Four of
the MCU with her long anticipated Black Widow

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.320
movie.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.620
This film will be set earlier in the MCU timeline,
between Captain America: Civil War and Avengers:

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:34.540
Infinity War, back when Natasha was still
alive and kicking butt.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.600
In the film, Natasha's Russian spy past seems
to be catching up with her as she contends

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.699
with fellow Red Room graduate Yelena Belova,
played by Florence Pugh.

00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:47.859
Rachel Weisz will also be part of the film,
but all we know about her character so far

00:00:47.859 --> 00:00:49.350
is that she's named Melina.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:53.980
However, fans have speculated that she could
be Melina Vostokoff, who's known as Iron maiden

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:55.080
in the comics.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:00.920
David Harbour is also on board as Alexei Shostakov,
otherwise known as the Red Guardian, a sort

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.920
of Russian version of Captain America.

00:01:03.149 --> 00:01:07.520
The film's main villain will be the copycat
Taskmaster, but there's no word yet on who

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.200
will be behind the character's skull mask.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.460
We'll see how Natasha fares against him on
May 1st, 2020.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:19.380
The stage was star-studded at 2019's San Diego
Comic Con with the brilliant ensemble cast

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.400
of The Eternals, set to release November 6th,
2020.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:27.520
The film will follow a group of ancient, godlike
aliens, many of whom have ties to Greek mythology.

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:33.320
Angelina Jolie will play Thena, whose character
is a reference to the Olympian goddess Athena.

00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:37.770
Richard Madden, of Game of Thrones fame, is
playing Ikaris, one of the mightiest Eternals,

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:40.460
named for the Greek myth of the boy who flew
too close to the sun.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:46.520
The Eternal Phastos, played by Brian Tyree
Henry, is a pseudo-Hephaestus due to his weapon-smithing

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:50.899
skills, while Sprite, played by Lia McHugh,
is a young Loki-like trickster.

00:01:50.899 --> 00:01:56.280
Kumail Nanjiani will play Kingo, an Eternal
who's been living in Japan for millennia following

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.659
the way of the samurai, and Don Lee will be
playing Gilgamesh.

00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:03.970
And although the characters of Ajak and the
deaf, Hermes-inspired Makkari are both male

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.400
in the comics, they'll be portrayed on-screen
by Salma Hayek and deaf actress Lauren Ridloff.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:14.880
Then, during the 2019 D23 expo in Anaheim,
a few more exciting names were added to the

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.620
already-impressive Eternals cast.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:22.180
Gemma Chan, who played the ill-fated Minn-Erva
in Captain Marvel, will be rejoining the MCU

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.520
in The Eternals as Sersi.

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:28.300
In the comics, Sersi lives among humans in
New York, throwing lavish parties where she

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:32.390
entertains her guests by passing her superpowers
off as magic tricks.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:37.540
Also joining the cast are Barry Keoghan as
the vicious ex-KGB agent Druig, and Game of

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:42.260
Thrones actor Kit Harington as the non-Eternal
superhero Dane Whitman, also known as Black

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:42.940
Knight.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.180
Harington's role will reunite him with his
Game of Thrones brother, Richard Madden, and

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.740
may seem like familiar territory for viewers,
since Black Knight is also the recipient of

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.960
a weighty family legacy and a thematically
significant sword.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:03:01.240
Canadian actor Simu Liu will be portraying
the hero Shang-Chi in Shang-Chi and the Legend

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:06.100
of the Ten Rings, and Kevin Feige has promised
that he will soon be a household name everywhere.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:10.640
Liu is probably best known for his role in
the sitcom Kim's Convenience, but his action

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:16.060
experience comes from his role on the TV series
Taken and his stunt work on the sets of Designated

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:18.020
Survivor and Heroes Reborn.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:23.360
Liu had actually tweeted about his interest
in the role back in December of 2018.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.670
Using the Shang-Chi hashtag, the actor wrote,

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:28.180
"OK Marvel, are we gonna talk or what?"

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:32.630
Apparently Marvel and Liu did talk, and he
thanked the studio on Twitter for getting

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.420
back to him when his role was officially announced.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.800
Starring alongside Liu in Shang-Chi and the
Legend of the Ten Rings will be Awkwafina

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.370
of Crazy Rich Asians fame.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:45.820
We'll also finally meet the real Mandarin,
as opposed to the fake version played by Ben

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.750
Kingsley in Iron Man 3.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.760
The Mandarin is the leader of the Ten Rings
terrorist organization and will be played

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.110
by award-winning actor Tony Leung.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:58.260
We'll see what kind of villain the real Mandarin
is on February 12th, 2021.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:03.800
Rather than focusing solely on big blockbuster
films, the MCU is expanding into the world

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.410
of television for Phase Four.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.210
The next few years will see a group of new
Marvel shows releasing on the streaming platform

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:13.880
Disney Plus, which will all tie directly into
the established world of the MCU.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.820
Releasing in the summer of 2021, the animated
series What If...? promises to be an especially

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.960
intriguing look at the world of Marvel.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.980
Based on the comic series of the same name,
What If...? will explore alternate versions

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:26.960
of the events in the MCU.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:31.660
The show's voice cast boasts a staggering
number of MCU movie stars, from Michael B.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.040
Jordan to Michael Rooker.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:37.360
The series' first episode will focus on what
would have happened if Hayley Atwell's character

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:42.400
Peggy Carter took the super soldier serum
instead of Steve Rogers in Captain America:

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:42.960
The First Avenger.

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:47.200
We'll watch these alternate timelines unfold
through the eyes of the Watcher, voiced by

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.420
Westworld's Jeffrey Wright.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.600
Steve Rogers' two best friends, Bucky Barnes
and Sam Wilson, will team up against Captain

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.760
America: Civil War villain Zemo in The Falcon
and the Winter Soldier, coming to Disney+

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.040
in the fall of 2020.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:05.360
The series will star Anthony Mackie and Sebastian
Stan as the Falcon and the Winter Soldier,

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:10.510
and will feature the return of Daniel Brühl
as Zemo, Emily VanCamp as Sharon Carter, and

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.940
Wyatt Russell as new character John Walker.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:16.070
But wait, isn't Sam Wilson supposed to be
Captain America now?

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:20.740
At the end of Avengers: Endgame, an aged Steve
Rogers handed his red, white, and blue shield

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.940
over to Sam as Bucky looked on approvingly.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:27.680
Never fear; in an interview with MTV News,
Mackie promised that the new Captain America

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:31.220
will make his debut at some point during The
Falcon and the Winter Soldier.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:35.320
He's already been fitted for his new star-spangled
suit, and according to Mackie,

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.300
"It looks really good."

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:41.960
Where did Loki go when he snatched up the
Tesseract and disappeared from 2012 during

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.720
Avengers: Endgame's Time Heist?

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:48.139
Apparently we'll get the chance to find out
in the upcoming Disney+ series Loki.

00:05:48.139 --> 00:05:51.800
Tom Hiddleston will be reprising his role
as the God of Mischief, and its been confirmed

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.139
that the series picks up right after Loki
winked out of existence.

00:05:55.139 --> 00:05:59.860
The actor told San Diego Comic Con that the
Loki series is one of the most exciting creative

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:03.950
opportunities he's ever encountered, saying
that he couldn't wait to get started.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:08.050
In addition to a new world, Loki may also
take us to a whole new time period.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:12.170
A preview image for the series shows Thor's
younger brother in front of a promotional

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.800
sign for the film Jaws, which was released
in 1975.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:19.840
Without the Time Stone, we have no idea how
Loki's managing his time hopping, but we'll

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.000
have to wait until the show releases in the
spring of 2021 to find out.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.380
Marvel has been pretty mysterious when it
comes to WandaVision, the third of its new

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:33.560
Disney+ shows, especially when it comes to
how the series fits into the current MCU timeline.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:37.580
Vision, played by Paul Bettany, was killed
by Thanos at the end of Avengers: Infinity

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.120
War.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:42.640
So how is he supposed to star alongside his
girlfriend Wanda in a show that takes place

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:44.520
after the events of Avengers: Endgame?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:49.340
In the words of Elizabeth Olsen, who plays
Wanda Maximoff, "It's gonna get weird."

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:53.560
Also unclear is how Monica Rambeau will factor
into the storyline of WandaVision.

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:58.710
The young Monica first charmed audiences with
her mischief in Captain Marvel, and WandaVision

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.380
will feature the character all grown up.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:05.060
The adult Monica will be played by Teyonah
Parris, who might even get in on the superhero

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:05.620
action herself.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:10.430
She'll be joined by Kat Dennings, reprising
her role as Darcy Lewis from the first two

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:15.220
Thor movies, Randall Park as Jimmy Woo from
Ant-Man and the Wasp, and newcomer Kathryn

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:17.770
Hahn as Wanda and Vision's nosy neighbor.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:21.790
We'll find out how they all come together
when WandaVision arrives on Disney+ in the

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.240
spring of 2021.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:28.860
Benedict Cumberbatch's Doctor Strange is getting
his own sequel in Phase Four, ominously titled

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:31.200
Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:36.240
Elizabeth Olsen's Wanda Maximoff will be co-starring
in the film, which will tie directly into

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:40.750
the events of WandaVision, and we wouldn't
be surprised if Multiverse of Madness also

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:44.820
crossed over with the alternate universes
of Marvel's animated What If...? series.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:49.720
The title for the Strange sequel leads us
to suspect that some Lovecraftian adventures

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:53.560
are in store for the Sorcerer Supreme, and
director Scott Derrickson seemed to confirm

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:54.700
our suspicions.

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:59.460
Speaking to the audience at San Diego Comic
Con about what drew him to the Doctor Strange

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:03.000
comics and what his plans were for the film's
sequel, Derrickson said,

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.000
"They dipped into the gothic, and the horror
and the horrific, and we're going to make

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.860
the first scary MCU film."

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:13.740
We'll discover the mysteries of the multiverse
when Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.010
is unveiled on May 7th, 2021.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:21.140
It's been a rocky relationship, but after
a brief trial separation, Sony and Marvel

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.820
have officially gotten back together for one
more film.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:29.990
Spider-Man 3 will release on July 16th, 2021,
making it a belated addition to the MCU's

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:30.540
Phase Four.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:34.800
No casting has been confirmed yet, but it's
safe to assume that in addition to Tom Holland,

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:40.260
we'll also be seeing the return of Jacob Batalon
as Ned and Zendaya as MJ, as well as Marissa

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.680
Tomei as Aunt May and Jon Favreau as Happy
Hogan.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:48.780
And given the cliffhanger at the end of Spider-Man:
Far From Home, we'd be surprised if J.K. Simmons

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:51.680
doesn't make an appearance as J. Jonah Jameson
as well.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:56.310
Like the first two films, the MCU's Spider-Man
3 will be helmed by director Jon Watts.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.459
No plot details have been released for the
third Spider-Man outing yet, including whether

00:09:00.459 --> 00:09:04.490
or not it will cross over with Venom or any
other part of Sony's own Spider-Verse.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:09.339
However, since the MCU only has Peter Parker
confirmed for one more movie, we're prepared

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:13.140
for Spider-Man 3 to pave the way for Spidey
to exit the Marvel Cinematic Universe for

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:13.700
good.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.980
Sony has been pretty eager to get notorious
Spider-Man villains the Sinister Six on screen

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:23.920
for a long time, and has in fact already introduced
several of the group's members, such as the

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.920
Vulture in Spider-Man: Homecoming and Mysterio
in Spider-Man: Far From Home.

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:32.709
Spider-Man 3 would be an excellent opportunity
to round out the lineup by bringing in another

00:09:32.709 --> 00:09:37.310
member of the group, and the most likely candidate
to battle Spidey in his third Marvel outing

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.260
is Kraven the Hunter.

00:09:39.029 --> 00:09:42.700
Before he'd officially been tapped to direct
Spider-Man 3, Jon Watts mentioned that if

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.480
the villain of the third movie was up to him,
it would be Kraven.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.310
What's more, Far From Home scribes Chris McKenna
and Erik Sommers have mentioned Kraven as

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.320
the next villain they'd like to see Spidey
fight.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:57.240
Additionally, Sony is already working on developing
a Kraven solo film, which means the hunter

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.040
is already on his way to the big screen.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:02.960
We'll just have to wait to find out whether
he makes a stop in the MCU first.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:09.260
Set to release in the fall of 2021, the series
logo for Hawkeye is almost an exact replica

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:13.400
of the one used for the much-loved comic run
by Matt Fraction and David Aja.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:18.639
Fraction and Aja's stylish series, which focused
on Clint Barton's everyday non-superhero life,

00:10:18.639 --> 00:10:22.610
placed particular emphasis on the archer's
various relationships, especially between

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.760
Barton and his protege, Kate Bishop.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:29.660
A master strategist and fighter with deadly
aim, the Kate Bishop of the comics is also

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:33.640
the leader of the Young Avengers, but is otherwise
a down-to-earth human like Barton.

00:10:33.649 --> 00:10:37.779
Bishop is confirmed to have a spot in the
Hawkeye series, and will presumably take over

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.060
the Hawkeye mantle from Clint at some point,
like she does in the comics.

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:45.680
We can't wait to see the dynamic between Jeremy
Renner's laid back Hawkeye as he mentors the

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:46.860
sharply witty Kate.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.160
After the massive success of Thor: Ragnarok,
director Taika Waititi is returning to helm

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:55.680
the fourth installment in the Thor series,
Thor: Love and Thunder.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:11:00.759
But when the film rumbles into theaters on
November 5th, 2021, it'll be bringing a new

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.040
god of thunder with it.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:06.470
While Chris Hemsworth will be returning as
Thor, Waititi announced that Natalie Portman's

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:10.800
Jane Foster will take on Mjolnir in Love and
Thunder to become Mighty Thor.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:15.120
In the comics, Jane became Thor when Thor
was no longer worthy of Mjolnir, while Thor

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:18.569
renamed himself Odinson and went off to travel
the universe.

00:11:18.569 --> 00:11:22.540
Tessa Thompson will also return as Valkyrie,
decreed the "King of New Asgard" at the end

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:23.100
of Endgame.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:27.740
Thompson already has her own ideas about what
Valkyrie's first order of business will be

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:31.720
in Love and Thunder, telling the audience
at San Diego Comic Con, quote, "She needs

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.760
to find her queen."

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:38.160
Many will remember Wesley Snipes' iconic performance
as the sharp-fanged, sharp-witted title character

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.529
in the original Blade trilogy of films.

00:11:40.529 --> 00:11:45.079
Now, Oscar-winning actor Mahershala Ali will
be stepping into the role of the half-vampiric

00:11:45.079 --> 00:11:47.860
vampire hunter for a new Marvel solo film.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:52.800
Calling the MCU's new Blade one of our time's
greatest working actors, Kevin Feige revealed

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:57.290
that Ali was already a huge fan of the Marvel
Cinematic Universe, as well as the character

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.860
of Blade himself, long before he was cast
in the role.

00:12:00.329 --> 00:12:01.420
Feige went on to say,

00:12:01.529 --> 00:12:03.480
"He's going to destroy the part.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.520
It's a dream.

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:09.140
It's the kind of dream casting that you almost
don't dare to dream that you can actually

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:09.680
do it."

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.460
The mysterious Twitter user who correctly
predicted a number of key plot points in Avengers

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:18.560
Endgame months before the movie came out is
back with a possible Phase Four scoop.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:22.120
According to that account, which goes by the
handle Roger Wardell,

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:27.300
"Marvel Studios are a big fan of David Morrissey
and are considering multiple roles for him

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:27.880
for Phase 4."

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:31.760
Morrissey gained fame among comic book fans
when he embodied one of The Walking Dead's

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:34.280
biggest and baddest villains, the Governor.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:39.160
He's been proving his versatility ever since,
playing more than just megalomaniacs, but

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:41.220
we wouldn't mind if he brought another bad
guy to life.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:46.040
We could see Morrissey taking on the role
of Spider-Man villain Norman Osborn, or iconic

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.980
Fantastic Four antagonist, Doctor Doom.

00:12:48.309 --> 00:12:51.660
On the other hand, just because Morrissey
has played villains in the past doesn't mean

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.680
he can't play a good guy now.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.640
After all, Marvel still has plenty of heroic
roles left to fill.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:01.019
Whether he comes aboard as a hero or a villain,
we're sure Morrissey will make a fantastic

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.220
addition to the MCU.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.360
Just when we thought we knew everything to
expect in Phase 4 of the MCU, Marvel threw

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:13.560
us for a loop by announcing a trio of additional
new MCU shows at the 2019 D23 Expo.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:17.340
Ms. Marvel will follow Pakistani American
teen hero Kamala Khan.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:22.449
In the comics, Kamala is an Inhuman who idolizes
Carol Danvers and takes up her pre-Captain

00:13:22.449 --> 00:13:26.000
Marvel mantle after discovering that she too
has superpowers.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:31.660
Showrunner Bisha K. Ali hasn't yet revealed
whether the series will show Kamala's first

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:35.379
days as Ms. Marvel, or whether it will pick
up with the character after she's already

00:13:35.379 --> 00:13:40.230
been established, similar to Peter Parker's
introduction in Captain America: Civil War.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.259
Kamala blazed new territory in the comics
as the first Muslim character to headline

00:13:44.259 --> 00:13:48.899
her own Marvel book, and to see her on screen
in the MCU will be a significant step forward

00:13:48.899 --> 00:13:53.189
in the battle for more diverse representation
in Hollywood, especially if the character

00:13:53.189 --> 00:13:55.080
eventually crosses over to the films.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:59.340
We don't have any idea yet when Ms. Marvel
will hit Disney+, or where it will fit into

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.360
Marvel's increasingly crowded schedule.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:05.460
However, since the series was announced as
part of Marvel's Phase 4 timeline, we can

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:08.680
safely assume it'll be before the end of 2021.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:15.200
The second of the new Disney+ shows announced
at D23 2019, Moon Knight follows former mercenary

00:14:15.209 --> 00:14:20.110
Marc Spector who gains superpowers from the
god Khonshu during a mission that goes sideways

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:20.640
in Egypt.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.960
In many ways, Moon Knight has functioned in
the comics as Marvel's version of Batman,

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:29.850
since Spector acts as a vigilante who uses
his substantial fortune to outfit himself

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.850
with advanced gadgetry that helps him hunt
down bad guys.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:36.959
However, Spector comes with a unique twist
that's bound to make his transition to screen

00:14:36.959 --> 00:14:39.429
both interesting, and potentially tricky.

00:14:39.429 --> 00:14:44.489
In the comics, Spector struggles with dissociative
identity disorder or D.I.D., which gives him

00:14:44.489 --> 00:14:49.049
three distinct personalities: in addition
to Spector, there's also wealthy businessman

00:14:49.049 --> 00:14:52.549
Steven Grant and street-smart cab driver Jake
Lockley.

00:14:52.549 --> 00:14:56.519
These three personalities all work together
to help Moon Knight to battle evil, and Moon

00:14:56.519 --> 00:15:00.209
Knight's creative team will have their work
cut out for them when it comes to avoiding

00:15:00.209 --> 00:15:04.949
the problematic tropes that often accompany
fictional portrayals of characters with D.I.D.

00:15:04.949 --> 00:15:09.139
Moon Knight will be helmed by lead writer
Jeremy Slater, who previously developed the

00:15:09.139 --> 00:15:12.869
Umbrella Academy comics into a successful
series for Netflix.

00:15:12.869 --> 00:15:15.399
Tweeting about his involvement on Moon Knight,
Slater wrote,

00:15:15.399 --> 00:15:19.709
"We’ve assembled a room full of brilliant
writers who truly love this character, and

00:15:19.709 --> 00:15:22.340
we’re all hard at work crafting something
special for you."

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:27.560
The last of the Disney+ shows announced at
D23 was She-Hulk, which will center around

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.740
Bruce Banner's cousin, Jennifer Walters.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:33.649
In the comics, Jennifer is an attorney who
receives her Hulk powers from an emergency

00:15:33.649 --> 00:15:35.639
blood transfusion from Bruce.

00:15:35.639 --> 00:15:40.149
Most likely, Jennifer will gain her powers
sometime after the "blip" in the Disney+ series,

00:15:40.149 --> 00:15:44.189
which will hopefully mean we'll get at least
a Mark Ruffalo cameo in She-Hulk, if not a

00:15:44.189 --> 00:15:45.499
more extensive role.

00:15:45.499 --> 00:15:49.730
The She-Hulk series will be helmed by showrunner
Jessica Gao, who won an Emmy for her writing

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.970
on the Rick and Morty episode “Pickle Rick."

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:56.029
As for who will play Jennifer herself, no
casting has been announced yet, although fans

00:15:56.029 --> 00:16:01.959
have proposed a variety of talented actresses
for the part including Jameela Jamil, Constance

00:16:01.959 --> 00:16:04.579
Wu, Stephanie Beatriz, and Blake Lively.

00:16:04.579 --> 00:16:09.019
Thanks to motion capture technology, whoever
Marvel casts in the role will probably not

00:16:09.019 --> 00:16:13.189
have to physically portray Jennifer in her
Hulked-out state, but will need to embody

00:16:13.189 --> 00:16:18.339
her wit, intelligence, strong moral compass,
and ability to snarkily break the fourth wall.

00:16:18.339 --> 00:16:22.189
As with Ms. Marvel and Moon Knight, we don't
know exactly when She-Hulk will slot into

00:16:22.189 --> 00:16:26.300
Marvel's Phase Four schedule, but expect it
to be before the end of 2021.

